  "migrationHeaderCorrection": {
    "new": "**Current status, 2026-11-15: published EventStore 5.1.1 clears the native-scanner package blocker. With the still-uncommitted Builds/Projects 5.1.1 catalog adoption, both complete Release/package CI solutions build, Projects passes its Folders and Conversations adapters 221/221 against released Folders Client/Contracts 1.4.0, and Folders parity passes 12/12. The current Folders candidate is 33 commits past v1.4.0 and unreleased. Jerome has conditionally accepted first installation through the [October 18 decision](story-1-17-first-install-decision-2026-10-18.md). Target/data disposition, exact released/deployed artifacts and measured operational entry/exit evidence remain unresolved. The existing-v1 migration is retained as the fallback. See the [2026-11-15 entry decision](#2026-11-15-eventstore-511-adoption-recheck-and-entry-decision); the 2026-10-24 summary this replaces remains in its dated section.**",
    "old": "**Current status, 2026-10-24: EventStore 3.127.0 restores both default Release/package solution gates. Projects consumes released Client/Contracts 1.3.1, and its full Server suite passes, including the direct and delegated folder adapters. The current Folders candidate is newer than 1.3.1 and its pending inventory has 34 stale rows, so no exact current-candidate release exists. Jerome has conditionally accepted first installation through the [October 18 decision](story-1-17-first-install-decision-2026-10-18.md). Target/data disposition, exact released/deployed artifacts and measured operational entry/exit evidence remain unresolved. The existing-v1 migration is retained as the fallback.**"
  },
